      "url": "https://www.ccgp.gov.cn/cggg/zygg/gzgg/202611/t20261124_27747661.htm",
      "title": "天津大学教职工团体惠民保服务项目更正公告",
      "selectedHtml": "<p><strong>一、项目基本情况</strong></p>        <p>原公告的采购项目编号：TDQT202600081　　　　　　</p>        <p>原公告的采购项目名称：天津大学教职工团体惠民保服务项目　　　　　　</p>        <p>首次公告日期：2026年11月16日　　　　　　</p>                  <p><strong>二、更正信息</strong></p>        <p>更正事项：采购文件  </p>        <p>更正内容：</p>        <p><p style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:25.0000pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">1.对供应商提出的疑问进行答复，</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">详见公告附件：</span>天津大学教职工团体惠民保服务项目&mdash;答疑文件；</p><p style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:25.0000pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">2.</span>响应文件提交的截止（开启）时间、磋商时间更正为：2026年11月30日下午13:30（北京时间）。</p><p style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:25.0000pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">3.竞争性磋商文件</span>（第三部分，第二点，第2条）</p><p style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:25.0000pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">原文为：</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:24pt;line-height:24pt;\">★2.理赔款支付方式、支付时效和赔付明细要求：供应商在受理申报的理赔单据后，每月结算一次通过银行卡转账的方式，直接将理赔款转入教职工个人账户。如申报人员需要，可按规定时间为其提供纸质的&ldquo;个人理赔清单&rdquo;和&ldquo;个人赔付通知书&rdquo;，及时解决申报人员在理赔时出现的问题。</p><p style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:25.0000pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">更正为：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:25.0000pt;\">★2.<span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">理赔款支付方式、支付时效和赔付明细要求：按照天津惠民保公开发布的《2026年度&ldquo;天津惠民保&rdquo;理赔须知》执行，理赔款</span>通过银行卡转账的方式直接转入教职工个人账户。如申报人员有需要，可及时提供对应书面理赔材料，并妥善处置申报人员理赔相关问题。</p><p style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:25.0000pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">4.竞争性磋商文件</span>（第六部分，第五点，评分细则中业绩部分）<span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">原文为：</span></p><table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:552px;border:none;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr style=\"height:2px;\">\t\t\t<td style=\"width:85px;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;vertical-align:center;\">\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;text-align:center;line-height:24.0000pt;\">业绩</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width:416px;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;vertical-align:center;\">\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:24pt;\">供应商提供2023年01月01日至磋商当日，与本项目内容相类似的业绩（包括补充医疗保险、短期健康保险或意外伤害保险等）业绩，每提供一项业绩1分，最高得5分。按照下述要求提供相关证明文件。提供的证明材料均不得遮挡涂黑，否则不予认定得分。</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;word-break:break-all;line-height:25.0000pt;\">（1）合同复印件。包括买卖双方名称及盖章、服务内容；</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;word-break:break-all;line-height:25.0000pt;\">（2）验收报告复印件（需加盖甲方章或用户章）；</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;word-break:break-all;line-height:25.0000pt;\">（3）用户出具的成功履行合同的相关证明材料复印件（需加盖甲方章或用户章）；</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:24pt;\">（4）第（2）、（3）项可提供任意一项。须提供（1）项+（2）项或（1）项+（3）项才被视为有效业绩。</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:24pt;\">注：提供供应商所属法人企业或所属法人企业其他分支机构的业绩不予认定得分。</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width:51px;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;vertical-align:center;\">\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;text-align:center;line-height:24.0000pt;\">5</p>\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;text-align:center;line-height:24.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"clear:both;\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:25.0000pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">更正为：</span></p><table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:552px;border:none;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr style=\"height:2px;\">\t\t\t<td style=\"width:85px;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;vertical-align:center;\">\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;text-align:center;line-height:24.0000pt;\">业绩</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width:416px;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;vertical-align:center;\">\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:24pt;\">供应商提供2023年01月01日至磋商当日，与本项目内容相类似的业绩（包括补充医疗保险、短期健康保险或意外伤害保险等）业绩，每提供一项业绩1分，最高得5分。按照下述要求提供相关证明文件。提供的证明材料均不得遮挡涂黑，否则不予认定得分。</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;word-break:break-all;line-height:25.0000pt;\">（1）合同复印件。包括买卖双方名称及盖章、服务内容；</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;word-break:break-all;line-height:25.0000pt;\">（2）验收报告或用户出具的成功履行合同的相关证明材料复印件（需加盖甲方章或用户章）；</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;word-break:break-all;line-height:25.0000pt;\">（3）与第（1）项合同对应的保单复印件，保单至少包含保险人名称、险种、保险期限，须加盖承保保险人公章；</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:24pt;\">（4）第（2）、（3）项可提供任意一项。须提供（1）项+（2）项或（1）项+（3）项才被视为有效业绩。</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:24pt;\">注：提供供应商所属法人企业或所属法人企业其他分支机构的业绩不予认定得分。</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width:51px;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;vertical-align:center;\">\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;text-align:center;line-height:24.0000pt;\">5</p>\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;text-align:center;line-height:24.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"clear:both;\">&nbsp;</div></p>        <p>更正日期：2026年11月24日　</p>                  <p><strong>三、其他补充事宜</strong></p>        <p><p style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;word-break:break-all;punctuation-trim:leading;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:25.0000pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">请各供应商在收到更正公告后，将&ldquo;更正公告确认函&rdquo;附在响应文件中，并将加盖单位公章的&ldquo;更正公告确认函&rdquo;扫描件发至zb@tjbd666.com邮箱。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;word-break:break-all;punctuation-trim:leading;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:25.0000pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">竞争性磋商文件与本公告有不符之处，以本公告为准，本公告未涉及内容仍以竞争性磋商文件为准。</span></p></p>                ",
